  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato (unpeeled) into 1cm fries and place on the lined oven tray. Season with salt and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Toss to coat and spread out in a single layer. Bake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5f6173233e99136b975472b9/step-48e1fb0f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile thinly slice onion and tomato.\n• Slice haloumi into 2 thin pieces per person.\n• In a medium bowl, combine haloumi, all-purpose seasoning, a pinch of pepper and a drizzle of olive oil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5f6173233e99136b975472b9/step-896690a1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook onion until softened and starting to brown, 5-6 mins. Transfer to a small bowl.\n• Return frying pan to medium heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook haloumi until golden, 2-3 mins per side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5f6173233e99136b975472b9/step-6bf67d0d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Bake burger buns directly on oven rack until heated through, 2-3 mins.\n• Halve buns and spread with mayonnaise. Top with salad leaves, tomato, haloumi and onion.\n• Serve with fries and your favourite dipping sauce.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5f6173233e99136b975472b9/step-7979dc8f.jpg"
    }
  ]
